# Copyright (c) 2026 The Polestar authors. Licensed GPL-3.0-only.
# Aurum adaptation: own namespace and next chapter; Druid-only display; explicit Zarrin trainer.
# Live-play fixes: southern Grell/totem camp, Mardant ramp access and a single deep cave visit.
# The starting route is incorporated here, not loaded from another guide pack.
# Source: https://github.com/fitzforge/polestar/blob/1775eb81e56fc1e127ae869ccec0b7dc8d7092fd/guides/forever/alliance/nightelf/01-teldrassil.guide
# Source SHA-256 (LF normalized): 3323038c8565c7e5654deaf0bb423fac680890b88954a98450540bb6284676c5
# See LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-CREDITS.txt in this pack.
# Quest IDs, coordinates and route text retain their verified source values.
# Original source includes the full Bear Form chain and Auberdine-Stormwind boat.
# Level range is a planning estimate, not a promise of exact earned XP.
# Profession/supply support: explicit NPCs and items checked in local Forever
# npcs/items/quests.json and `polestar find`. Training prices/minimum levels
# and vendor stock still need a live check. Profession training and the knife
# are required; supply visits are required, with purchase amounts adjusted to money.
# This revision removes the Ban'ethil/Ursal dependency branch for solo release play.
# Migrate progress by quest/goal identity; old numeric step indices must not be reused.

step Aldrassil
  note Do not sell any meat, Light Leather or leather scraps. Save them for Cooking 20 and Leatherworking 20 later in this guide.
  tip You start at the foot of Aldrassil, the great tree of Shadowglen.
  accept 456                                  -- Conservator Ilthalaine
  accept 458                                  -- Melithar Staghelm, by the path
  turnin 458 choose 247846                    -- Choose Pelt Collecting for Beginners, then use it to learn Skinning.
  accept 459
  accept 97977

# Fel Moss camp: local data/forever/objects.json, object 668482, map 1438,
# has a Gnarlpine Totem at 55.8,44.3 in the Era frame. Within 100 yd are
# 13 recorded Grell/Grellkin spawns (NPCs 1988/1989 in npcs.json) and 3 totems;
# the northern totem camp at 55.1,39.7 has 9 droppers within the same radius.
# Item 3297 drops from both mobs (items.json); quest 459.1 requires 8.
# An explicit collect point keeps this camp first; other spots remain manual alternatives.
step The Balance of Nature
  tip Kill Young Nightsabers and Young Thistle Boars near Aldrassil.
  kill 2031 quest 456.1
  kill 1984 quest 456.2

step Ilthalaine and Dirania
  tip Return to Ilthalaine at Aldrassil, then speak to Dirania east of the tree.
  turnin 456                                  -- Conservator Ilthalaine, back at Aldrassil.
  accept 457
  accept 3120 only Druid                      -- Take Verdant Sigil for your first visit to Mardant.
  accept 4495                                 -- Dirania Silvershine, east of the tree; available from level 2.

step Terunne: get your Skinning Knife
  buy 7005 x1 npc 267333                      -- Buy one knife for 10 copper before the next hunting loop.
  buy 277114 x1 npc 267333                    -- One Apprentice's Skinning Satchel, 25 copper.

step Mardant: learn Mark of the Wild
  tip Inside Aldrassil, follow the western ramp to Mardant's alcove on the first landing. Learn Mark of the Wild for 10 copper, then cast it on yourself.
  turnin 3120 only Druid                      -- Hand Verdant Sigil to Mardant, then train.
  learn 1126 "Mark of the Wild (Rank 1)" npc 3597

step Dellylah: sell junk and buy water
  tip Visit Dellylah inside Aldrassil. Sell grey items and unwanted gear, then buy as much Refreshing Spring Water as you can afford. Keep your equipped gear and quest items.
  vendor npc 6091 "Sell junk at Dellylah"      -- Keep ALL meat, Light Leather and leather scraps for Cooking 20 and Leatherworking 20. Keep cloth and other crafting materials too.
  buy 159 x5 npc 6091                         -- Five is the minimum. Buy more bundles with your remaining money before leaving.

step Southern Grell camp
  tip Gather Fel Moss from Grells and Grellkin while destroying the nearby Gnarlpine Totems.
  collect 3297 quest 459.1 @55.8,44.3 era    -- Farm the southern Grell and Grellkin camp beside the totems.
  interact 668482 quest 97977.1               -- Gnarlpine Totem

step Thistle Boars on the way north
  tip Kill Thistle Boars as you head north toward Iverron outside Shadowthread Cave.
  kill 1985 quest 457.2                       -- Finish Thistle Boars while travelling north toward Iverron.

step Iverron: A Good Friend
  tip Speak to Iverron west of the cave mouth and accept his request for an antidote.
  turnin 4495                                 -- Iverron waits west of the cave mouth. Stay outside the cave for this visit.
  accept 3519
  note Return to Aldrassil; use your Hearthstone if it is ready and still bound to Shadowglen.

# Mardant: quest 3120 objective text places NPC 3597 inside Aldrassil in Shadowglen.
# Ramp/first-landing alcove: https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=3597/mardant-strongoak#comments (Taraezor).
step Back at Aldrassil
  turnin 459                                  -- Tarindrella
  turnin 97977
  accept 97979                                -- Shanda: enter Aldrassil at the front entrance and go up its ramp.
  turnin 97979
  turnin 3519                                 -- Dirania Silvershine.
  accept 3521                                 -- Unlock the antidote ingredients before killing the spiders.
  accept 916                                  -- Gilshalan Windwalker, on the tree's ramp
  vendor npc 6091 "Sell junk at Dellylah"     -- Keep all meat, Light Leather, scraps, cloth and quest items. Save 2 silver for Moonfire and Rejuvenation at level 4; restock water with spare money.
  buy 159 x5 npc 6091 optional                -- Five is a minimum, not a limit. Buy more water with your spare money.

# Outside-cave pass: quest 916 needs 10 item 5166 from NPC 1986, which also
# drops the antidote's item 10640. Quest 917 requires turning in 916 first.
# Save NPC 1994/item 277190 for the later egg trip rather than entering twice.
# Local data/forever/{quests,items,npcs}.json verifies these relationships
# and Githyiss's Era position, map 1438, 56.65,26.31. The mouth is the same
# verified 57,32 used by the second visit below (guides-reported.test.js).
# Client geometry build 1.60.1.70425: `nav path 1438 57,32 1438 56.65,26.31`
# found 343 yd of walk/indoor route, no falls: central passage to 56.53,26.92,
# left via 55.75,25.51 and 55.75,25.14, then up around 55.99,24.95 and
# 56.16,24.95 to the ledge at 56.65,25.63 and the boss. These are directions,
# not an automatic interior path: the guide points to the mouth, then the boss area.
step Venom and antidote ingredients
  tip Gather Moonpetal Lilies at the ponds north of Aldrassil, then kill Webwood Spiders outside Shadowthread Cave for both venom sacs and the antidote ichor. Do not go to Githyiss yet: the egg quest unlocks only after the venom turn-in. Finish Mangy Nightsabers on the loop and gather mushrooms on the return through the Grell camps.
  kill 2032 quest 457.1
  collect 10641 quest 3521.2 @57.73,37.53 era -- Moonpetal Lilies by the ponds, on the way north.
  collect 5166 npc 1986 quest 916.1 @57.19,32.28 era -- Farm Webwood Spiders outside the cave mouth. Save the deep cave for the egg and Fang together.
  collect 10640 npc 1986 quest 3521.3 @57.19,32.28 era -- The same Webwood Spiders provide the antidote's Webwood Ichor.
  collect 10639 quest 3521.1 @55.8,44.3 era   -- Hyacinth Mushrooms from Grells and Grellkin, or mushroom pickups along the return.

step Aldrassil
  turnin 916                                  -- Gilshalan Windwalker
  accept 917                                  -- Webwood Egg unlocks after Webwood Venom. Take it before entering the cave.
  turnin 457                                  -- Conservator Ilthalaine

# Actual spell checks: trainer-window visits do not prove a spell was learned.
# EarlyTraining.lua makes level-4 spells required only once they are available.
step Mardant: train your Druid spells
  tip Sell spare loot first. At Mardant's first-landing alcove, learn Mark of the Wild, plus Moonfire and Rejuvenation from level 4. Each level-4 spell costs 1 silver.
  learn 1126 "Mark of the Wild (Rank 1)" npc 3597
  learn 8921 "Moonfire (Rank 1)" npc 3597 optional
  learn 774 "Rejuvenation (Rank 1)" npc 3597 optional

step Dirania: collect Iverron's antidote
  turnin 3521                                 -- Dirania Silvershine: finish other town errands before taking the timed delivery.
  accept 3522                                 -- The antidote expires after five minutes. Go directly to Iverron before entering the cave.

# Shadowthread Cave: "The eggs are at 57,26 / The cave is at 57,32"
# (https://www.wowhead.com/classic/quest=917, comments).
step Iverron and Shadowthread Cave
  tip Deliver the timed antidote to Iverron first. With Webwood Egg in your quest log, enter the cave once for both the egg and Githyiss's Fang.
  turnin 3522                                 -- Iverron, west of the cave mouth. Deliver before fighting inside.
  goto 57.0,32.0 "Shadowthread Cave"

step Webwood Egg and Githyiss
  tip Follow the central tunnel and then the left-hand rising path to the rear ledge. Kill Githyiss and loot her Fang, and collect a Webwood Egg on this same visit. Start the Fang quest from the item before taking the next return step.
  collect 277190                              -- Githyiss the Vile, at the rear ledge inside the cave.
  collect 5167 quest 917.1
  accept 97236                                -- Use the Fang of Githyiss in your bags to start its quest.

step Aldrassil
  tip Hand both cave quests to Gilshalan, then climb to Tenaron.
  spiritreturn 58.71,42.33 "Shadowglen graveyard" r 35
  turnin 97236                                -- Gilshalan takes both the Fang and the egg.
  turnin 917                                  -- Gilshalan Windwalker
  accept 920
  turnin 920                                  -- Tenaron Stormgrip, at the top of the tree
  accept 921

step The Shadowglen moonwell
  tip Fill the Crystal Phial at the moonwell north of Aldrassil, then return to Tenaron. Iverron's antidote was delivered before the cave, so there is no second delivery detour here.
  use 5185 quest 921.1 @60.0,33.0 -- Fill the quest phial at this moonwell. Completion is tracked from the filled-phial objective; the item button belongs to this step only.

step Tenaron Stormgrip
  tip Back to the top of Aldrassil. The Lost Journal lies beside him.
  spiritreturn 58.71,42.33 "Shadowglen graveyard" r 35
  turnin 921
  accept 928
  accept 96630                                -- Lost Journal
  vendor npc 6091 "Sell junk at Dellylah"     -- Keep all meat, Light Leather, scraps, Small Spider Legs, your Skinning Knife and other crafting materials. Restock Ice Cold Milk from level 5; reserve spell money.
  note Skin eligible beasts as you complete normal quests. Keep the leather and scraps for Leatherworking; there is no separate skinning grind. Reserve seven Small Spider Legs for Zarrin's cooking quest.

step Porthannius
  tip Leave Shadowglen by the path south-east of Aldrassil: Porthannius stands beside it, where it goes down towards the road to Dolanaar.
  accept 2159                                 -- Porthannius

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dolanaar

step Zenn Foulhoof
  tip Follow the road from Shadowglen toward Dolanaar. Take Zenn's quest as you pass him east of town, so nearby beast drops count immediately.
  accept 488

step Dolanaar
  tip Finish the northern errands, then the inn and southern trainers.
  turnin 96630                                -- Lyreena Duskblade, by the campfire
  accept 997                                  -- Syral Bladeleaf
  train First Aid Apprentice npc 6094          -- Byancie, north of the inn: learn First Aid and the available bandage recipe. Already knowing Apprentice First Aid satisfies this goal. Use spare cloth for bandages between fights; do not check this done if training was not learned.
  talk 3608                                   -- Aldia: check your empty bag slots. Buy and equip an affordable bag only after reserving money for drinks, spells and Leatherworking. Keep a larger bag rather than replacing it with a pouch.
  buy 4496 x1 npc 3608 optional              -- Aldia: buy and equip a Small Brown Pouch only if you have an empty bag slot and money left after training and drinks. Do not replace a larger bag.
  vendor 3609                                 -- Shalomon: sell junk and repair. Keep all meat, Light Leather and scraps for Cooking 20 and Leatherworking 20, plus cloth and quest items.
  turnin 2159                                 -- Innkeeper Keldamyr
  sethome "Dolanaar" npc 6736                 -- Innkeeper Keldamyr
  vendor npc 6736 "Restock at Innkeeper Keldamyr"                                 -- Innkeeper Keldamyr: refill to about 10-20 Ice Cold Milk (level 5+) for the next quest loops, or as much as you can afford after training and repairs. Carry a few usable foods; use looted or cooked food first.
  buy 1179 x10 npc 6736 optional             -- Druid supply stop: if level 5 or above, refill to about 10 Ice Cold Milk, or buy fewer if money is tight. Keep money for spells and profession training; skip if your existing drinks are sufficient.
  train class
  turnin 928                                  -- Corithras Moonrage, south of the inn
  accept 929
  note Keep 7 Small Spider Legs for Recipe of the Kaldorei at Zarrin. These are the Teldrassil cooking items; Gooey Spider Legs are a different item used later in Duskwood. Keep cloth, leather, scraps and useful cooking meat when selling.

step Zenn's Bidding and the Starbreeze moonwell
  tip Nightsabers, Strigid Owls and Webwood Lurkers live along the road east. The moonwell is at the west edge of Starbreeze Village.
  collect 3409 quest 488.1                    -- Nightsaber Fang
  collect 3411 quest 488.2                    -- Strigid Owl Feather
  collect 3412 quest 488.3                    -- Webwood Spider Silk
  use 5619 quest 929.1 @63.4,58.1 -- Fill the quest phial at this moonwell. Completion is tracked from the filled-phial objective; the item button belongs to this step only.
  turnin 488                                  -- Zenn Foulhoof, on the way back

step Dolanaar quests
  tip Finish the campfire, then the northern building before heading south to Zarrin.
  accept 96606                                -- Lyreena Duskblade
  complete 96606 @57.7,56.7                   -- /sit by Lyreena's campfire until you get Boosted Rest
  turnin 96606
  accept 96634
  accept 475                                  -- Athridas Bearmantle
  accept 98391                                -- Laurna Morninglight. This delivery goes to Sister Aquinne in Darnassus during the later city visit; a green completed entry in your log is expected until then.
  accept 87288                                -- Aldia, upstairs in the northern Dolanaar building; take the ramp.
  buy 4471 x1 npc 3608                       -- Aldia: keep one Flint and Tinder; it is a reusable tool, not one consumed per fire.
  buy 4470 x5 npc 3608                       -- Five Simple Wood will make five Basic Campfire Kits once Cooking reaches 20.
  accept 932                                  -- Tallonkai Swiftroot, on the upper platform of the Dolanaar tree; follow its ramp up.
  accept 2438
  accept 489                                  -- Sentinel Kyra Starsong
  accept 99046                                -- Hold this delivery for Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow on the road to the Oracle Glade; no immediate backtrack is needed.
  turnin 929                                  -- Corithras Moonrage
  accept 933

step Zarrin: Cooking and spider legs
  complete 96634 @57.12,61.30                 -- Speak with Zarrin, the friendly Cooking trainer south of the inn, to complete the quest objective.
  turnin 96634                                -- Zarrin
  train Cooking Apprentice npc 6286          -- Learn Cooking from Zarrin while already here. This is complete only once the profession is learned; do not mark it done just for visiting him.
  accept 4161                                 -- Zarrin
  note Use your gathered ingredients to practise Cooking when convenient, but reserve the 7 Small Spider Legs until this quest is handed in. Buy recipe ingredients only after checking the price; this route does not require buying a stockpile.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- East: Starbreeze and Lake Al'Ameth


step East to Starbreeze Village
  tip Fel Cones lie under the trees all around Dolanaar and Zenn. Nightsabers and Webwood Lurkers keep roaming the road east. Tallonkai's Dresser is in the house on the hill at the east end of the village.
  collect 3418 quest 489.1
  collect 280087 quest 87288.1                -- Nightsabers
  # Private build uses a quest-tracked kill goal for Polestar #356; progress still counts legs.
  collect 5465 npc 1998 quest 4161.1 @59.55,59.70 -- Kill Webwood Lurkers along the road east of Dolanaar; keep the Small Spider Legs for Zarrin.
  turnin 475                                  -- Gaerolas Talvethren, upstairs in the Starbreeze building; use the interior ramp.
  accept 476
  collect 8048 quest 2438.1 @68.0,59.6        -- Tallonkai's Dresser

step Zenn Foulhoof
  turnin 489

step Lake Al'Ameth
  tip Stay around Lake Al'Ameth by Denalan. Kill the nearby Timberlings for seeds and gather the sprouts among them, then return to him. There is no northern Elder Timberling trip for this step.
  turnin 997                                  -- Denalan
  accept 918
  accept 919
  collect 5168 npc 2022 quest 918.1 @61.53,69.35 -- Kill the level 5-6 Timberlings around Denalan and the lake while gathering Timberling Sprouts.
  collect 5169 quest 919.1
  turnin 918
  accept 922                                  -- Keep this delivery for Rellian Greenspyre in Darnassus; it is scheduled with the city visit after the outdoor loops.
  turnin 919

step Dolanaar
  tip Zarrin and Kal first; finish supplies and the northern building before finding Amara.
  turnin 4161                                 -- Zarrin
  train class
  vendor 3609                                 -- Sell grey loot and repair. Keep all meat, Light Leather, scraps and cloth; save seven Small Spider Legs until their quest is handed in.
  vendor npc 6736 "Restock at Innkeeper Keldamyr"                                 -- Refill your usable drinks to about 10-20 before leaving for Fel Rock and the outdoor western loop; buy fewer if money is needed for the Leatherworking trainer on this loop. Do not buy drinks above your level.
  turnin 476                                  -- Athridas Bearmantle
  turnin 87288                                -- Aldia, upstairs in the northern Dolanaar building; take the ramp.
  turnin 2438                                 -- Tallonkai Swiftroot, on the upper platform of the Dolanaar tree; follow its ramp up.
  accept 2459
  accept 487 -- Amara patrols the road west of Dolanaar. Click her target button while searching; wait if she is fighting.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West: Fel Rock to Gnarlpine Hold

# Client-derived cave boundary; private build adds its verified floor height.
# Explore retains terrain routing for the next objective in Polestar 0.2.5.

step Fel Rock's mouth
  explore 54.60,52.10 "Fel Rock entrance" r 15

step Fel Rock
  tip Use the target button to find Lord Melenas. Check the cave's chambers and ledges; he has several spawn locations.
  collect 5221 quest 932.1                    -- Lord Melenas

step The road to Darnassus
  tip Gnarlpine Ambushers hide along the road west of Fel Rock.
  kill 2152 quest 487.1
  turnin 487                                  -- Find Amara on the same road patrol after the six ambushers; hand this in now instead of carrying it through the western loop.
  train Leatherworking Apprentice npc 3605    -- Nadyia Maneweaver, in the hut north of the road: learn Leatherworking now. Sell spare loot if short of money; leave this goal incomplete until the profession is actually learned.
  train Skinning Apprentice npc 6287         -- Radnaal beside Nadyia is a catch-up check for Skinning. Already knowing Apprentice Skinning completes it; learn it here if still missing.
  buy 7005 x1 npc 3605                        -- Knife check: Nadyia sells a replacement if needed. One already in your bags satisfies the goal.
  note Turn scraps into Light Leather and practise recipes with your gathered materials when resting. Buy thread only for recipes you intend to make; do not spend your spell or drink money buying bulk leather. At a later town visit, raise the profession rank when its current skill cap is near.

step The Pools of Arlithrien
  tip Stay outdoors and head south-west from the road to the Pools of Arlithrien. Do not enter Ban'ethil: the relics, Rageclaw and its escort are omitted from this solo route. The moonwell sits beside the pools.
  use 5621 quest 933.1 @42.4,67.1 -- Fill the quest phial at this moonwell. Completion is tracked from the filled-phial objective; the item button belongs to this step only.

step Gnarlpine Hold
  tip South of the pools. The Strange Fruited Plant grows by the Hold.
  accept 930                                  -- Strange Fruited Plant

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to Dolanaar

step Hearth to Dolanaar
  tip Finish the southern hand-ins and supplies, then visit Tallonkai upstairs.
  hearth "Dolanaar"
  turnin 933                                  -- Corithras Moonrage
  accept 7383
  vendor 3609                                 -- Sell unwanted loot and repair. Keep all meat, Light Leather, scraps, cloth, quest items and library books.
  vendor npc 6736 "Restock at Innkeeper Keldamyr"                                 -- Restock usable drinks and food before the Ferocitas trip. Aim for 10-20 drinks, subtracting what is already in your bags; keep training money aside.
  turnin 932                                  -- Tallonkai Swiftroot, on the upper platform of the Dolanaar tree; follow its ramp up.

step Ferocitas the Dream Eater
  tip Gnarlpine Mystics and Ferocitas camp north-east of Starbreeze Village. Ferocitas drops the Gnarlpine Necklace: open it for the jewel.
  kill 7235 quest 2459.1
  collect 8050 quest 2459.2 @69.4,53.4
  spiritreturn 56.22,63.29 "Dolanaar graveyard" r 35
  turnin 2459                                 -- Tallonkai Swiftroot, back on the upper platform of the Dolanaar tree; follow the ramp up.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Oracle Glade

step Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow
  tip Take the road north-west from Dolanaar towards the Oracle Glade; she lies hurt beside it.
  turnin 99046
  accept 99047

step The Oracle Glade
  tip The moonwell is in the middle of the glade. The Strange Fronded Plant grows at its north end.
  use 18152 quest 7383.1 @38.4,34.1 -- Fill the quest phial at this moonwell. Completion is tracked from the filled-phial objective; the item button belongs to this step only.
  accept 937                                  -- Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak, by the moonwell
  accept 931                                  -- Strange Fronded Plant

step Bloodfeather harpies
  tip The Bloodfeather harpies nest on the slopes west and north of the glade. Pull one at a time; favour the weaker varieties for belts and avoid extra Matriarch pulls because their spells and healing slow down a solo Druid.
  collect 5204 quest 937.1                    -- Bloodfeather Belt

step Sentinel Arynia Cloudsbreak
  tip Back to the moonwell.
  turnin 937
  accept 98392

step The named harpies
  tip Hatescreech and Windmistress Gaedress fly just west of the moonwell, Witchmother Arysa further north.
  collect 280831 quest 98392.1                -- Hatescreech's Amulet
  collect 280832 quest 98392.2                -- Windmistress Gaedress' Amulet
  collect 280834 quest 98392.3                -- Witchmother Arysa's Amulet

