step Level 10 and Bear Form training
  tip Denalan's fruit and frond quests and Byancie's return are handed in before this check. Use their banked XP before visiting Kal. If still short, finish nearby level-appropriate quest work or skin ordinary beasts; stop as soon as level 10 is reached. This checkpoint does not assume tent, rested or party XP.
  level 10
  accept 5925 only Druid                      -- Kal: take Heeding the Call only after level 10; Mathrengyl receives it in Darnassus.
  train class

step Campfire supplies for the road
  tip At Zarrin in southern Dolanaar, use meat gathered during the quest loops to reach Cooking 20 and learn Basic Campfire. Craft five kits using the five Simple Wood already bought; keep Flint and Tinder in your bags. These are inventory targets, so existing supplies count. Do not spend class-training money on an unnecessary crafting grind.
  skill Cooking 20
  learn 1229737 "Basic Campfire" npc 6286
  collect 279981 x5 @57.12,61.30              -- Craft until five Basic Campfire Kits are in your bags; one wood makes one kit.

step Sentinel Eralya Leafshadow
  tip Take the road north-west from Dolanaar again; she still lies beside it, on the way to Darnassus.
  turnin 99073

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darnassus and Rut'theran

step Nadyia: tents for the journey
  tip Stop at Nadyia's hut north of the road on the way to Darnassus. Use the leather saved from normal skinning to reach Leatherworking 20, finish Camping 101 and learn Camp Tent. Each craft uses five Light Leather and makes two tents; three crafts provide six. Prepare at least five tents without buying an arbitrary extra stock of leather.
  skill Leatherworking 20
  complete 97946 @41.88,49.44                 -- Speak with Nadyia; this quest objective is conversation, not killing the trainer.
  turnin 97946
  learn 1229432 "Camp Tent" npc 3605
  collect 279978 x5 @41.88,49.44              -- Craft Camp Tents until at least five are in your bags.
  note Use a campfire and tent during natural breaks, crafting or group waits. Sit nearby to build rested XP up to 5% of a level; it does not add another 5% if you already exceed that amount. Camping features share a one-hour cooldown. The sleeping bag is a separate later reward.

step Darnassus
  zone Darnassus
  accept 6344                                 -- Mydrannul: Craftsmen's Terrace, just inside Darnassus.
  turnin 935                                  -- Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm, on the upper floor of the Cenarion Enclave tree. Use the ramps inside.
  turnin 940                                  -- Fandral also takes the Oracle Tree report; same visit.
  note Decline Grove of the Ancients; its Darkshore delivery is outside this route.
  accept 98046
  turnin 5925 only Druid                      -- Mathrengyl Bearwalker, on the middle level of the Cenarion Enclave tree; climb the interior ramp.
  accept 5921 only Druid
  turnin 922                                  -- Rellian Greenspyre: just south of the Cenarion Enclave.
  turnin 98046                                -- Lariia, in the Temple of the Moon
  accept 98065
  turnin 98065                                -- Tyrande Whisperwind, on the upper level of the Temple of the Moon; climb the side ramp from Lariia.
  turnin 98391                                -- Sister Aquinne: west side of Darnassus, toward the portal.
  note Before leaving, check Skinning, Leatherworking, Cooking, First Aid and your Skinning Knife. Finish any skipped training here.

step Nessa: delivery and fishing supplies
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Take the portal to Rut'theran Village and go straight to Nessa. Finish her quest handoff and buy the fishing supplies before going to Vesprystus. Keep the lures for Stormwind.
